# Mau thong diep commit — ca nhom copy theo form nay
# Cach dung:
#   git config commit.template .gitmessage
# Sau do moi lan `git commit` se tu hien mau nay.
#
# QUY TAC (xem QUY-DINH-NHANH-VA-COMMIT.md):
#   <loai>(<pham-vi>): <mo-ta-ngan-gon-tieng-viet>
#
# Loai hop le:
#   tinh-nang | sua-loi | tai-lieu | kiem-thu | tai-cau-truc | dinh-dang | cau-hinh | hoan-lai

# VI DU (xoa cac dong vi du nay khi viet commit that):
# tinh-nang(hello): them API POST /api/hello
# sua-loi(hello): xu ly ten trong khi goi API
# tai-lieu(chung): bo sung huong dan test API bang Swagger

# --- Viet commit cua ban o duoi dong nay ---

<loai>(<pham-vi>): <mo-ta-ngan-gon>
